<p>Fonte Cindam     N.A.	     -350	   4.380 (a) 4.730</p>
<p>JP Morgan	  6.0  pct	 -270	   4.380 (a) 4.650</p>
<p>Matrix	     7.0  pct	 -270	   4.380 (a) 4.650</p>
